        "claim": "GSAERU模型通过图摘要技术将大规模动态图映射为固定规模的新图，从而解决GNN模型输出无法直接输入到RNN模型中进行训练的问题。",
        "claim_en": "The GSAERU model maps large-scale dynamic graphs to fixed-size new graphs via graph summarization technology, thereby solving the problem of GNN model outputs being unable to directly input into RNN models for training.",
